      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "USpringArmComponent*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FRotator",
      "docs": "Get the target rotation we inherit, used as the base target for the boom rotation.\nThis is derived from attachment to our parent and considering the UsePawnControlRotation and absolute rotation flags."
    },
    {
